{"id": "05", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Then Tank came for your lunch. [pause] Level eighty. [pause] A boss fight."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[panicked, whispering] Run? Fight? Hide under the table?"}, {"speaker": "TANK", "text": "[low, gruff] Lunch."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "But then you saw it. [pause] Three health. Hungry. Tired. [pause] Lonely."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quietly] ...He hasn't eaten all day."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And above his head... a tiny question mark."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[gently] Here. [pause] Take the whole thing. I'm not that hungry."}, {"speaker": "TANK", "text": "[confused] ...You're GIVING it to me?"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[cheerful] Quest complete! [pause] Plus thirty-seven health."}, {"speaker": "TANK", "text": "[quietly, confused] Thanks... I guess."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[carefully] Tank? [pause] Why do you always take people's lunch?"}, {"speaker": "TANK", "text": "[quietly, embarrassed] My dad works nights. [pause] Nobody makes me lunch. [pause] Okay? Don't tell anybody."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[kind] My mom always makes way too much. [pause] You can have half. Every day."}, {"speaker": "BENJI", "text": "[amazed] Did Tank just say THANKS?!"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And that's when you learned the rule. [pause] Kindness gives people health. [pause] And it gives YOU experience."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 5.6000000000000005, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 74, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ", "start_time_seconds": 5.6000000000000005, "end_time_seconds": 9.136, "character_start_index": 74, "character_end_index": 130, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "SOYHLrjzK2X1ezoPC6cr", "start_time_seconds": 9.136, "end_time_seconds": 10.32, "character_start_index": 130, "character_end_index": 149